   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GLOBAL PLAN OF ACTION 2ND PAYMENT OF 2022-2024 STRATEGIC FUNDING</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Frontline AIDS works to ensure marginalised people living with HIV do not die of AIDS-related illnesses, and eliminate new HIV infections amongst the most marginalised people. The objective of the grant is to increase global investment, support community advocacy, monitor and document human rights violations, develop innovative solutions to support the most marginalised and provide technical assistance for civil society and governments to enhance delivery, governance and monitoring of national HIV responses.</narrative>
  </description>
